	(text "Telemetry is NOT autonomous protection. 10nF C0G filters are BEFORE the switch.\nThe47k ADC bleeds load each divider; use calculated loaded gains."
		(at 25.4 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "483c1f5a-e7d7-4c2a-9058-c3a7d00d5e7e")
	)
	(text "CUSTOM — REVIEW REQUIRED: U1300A–E\nConstruction authorized; SEL HIGH closes S <-> D, LOW opens."
		(at 190.5 46.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(color 0 255 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cb39e706-abd2-4c6d-81e8-2d2527d8c1aa")
	)
	(text "PA0/PA1/PA4/PA5: analog mode, no pulls. Start10Hz scan.\n160.5-cycle sampling, fADC <=35MHz; calibrate after power-up.\nHonor ADC regulator/reference startup; rearm after >100us idle.\nDiscard first conversion after channel changes; wait >=2ms\nfollowing switch qualification or large rail transition."
		(at 215.9 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "38e544f6-b801-4ddc-839e-41a076459a80")
	)
	(text "OPEN: actual settling/crosstalk, reference/VREFINT accuracy,\nall-path injection/leakage and rapid/slow brownout/PVT.\nIoff +/-2uA atVDD=0 is not a floating/brownout bound.\nTPS assertion20us /hysteresis29mV are TYP only.\nDedicated qualifier; no shared SWD control or MCU permission."
		(at 215.9 240.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.85 0.85)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "507aea79-a347-4263-874d-072c2fd55f8f")
	)
	(text "DEVELOPMENT: SYS/BATT <=60V, protected5V <=6V, essential3V3 <=3.6V are imposed ceilings, NOT arbitrary-fault survival.\nS11 fields saved; exact field-anchor/font/visibility API limitations remain. Stock mapped lands reused; TMUX7.70x5.90mm/TPS3.86x4.04mm reservation.\nNo ADC value authorizes power. RBF,3V3 OV, charger-to-pack fault, coupled startup / hot SOA and commissioning remain OPEN."
		(at 25.4 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.75 0.75)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "612fc0ec-ee56-49de-8300-449a81645ba1")
	)
